  "slug": "shaft-cocktail-recipe-11907565",
  "name": "Shaft Cocktail",
  "recipe_type": "drink",
  "brief_description": "The Shaft cocktail, a Western Canadian classic, combines vodka, coffee liqueur, Irish cream, and espresso into a smooth, coffee-driven cocktail. Rich, creamy, and quietly strong, it blurs the line between cocktail and caffeine fix.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Fill a rocks glass with 1 cup ice. In a cocktail shaker, combine vodka, coffee liqueur, Irish cream, espresso and remaining ice. Cover and shake until chilled, 15 to 20 seconds. Strain into the rocks glass and garnish with coffee beans, if using."
    }
  ],
